    "content": "<h1>📧 Email Templates — Sales &amp; Prospecting</h1><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Revital Productions — Growth Space | Internal Use Only | June 2026</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p></p><blockquote><strong>PURPOSE:</strong> This document contains cold outreach and prospecting-specific email templates used before a client signs — specifically the Free Marketing Assessment sequence. These templates are unique to the Growth space and are not duplicated in the main Email Templates doc in Operations.</blockquote><blockquote><strong>For all other email templates</strong> (onboarding, client communication, approvals, offboarding, follow-up sequences) — see the <strong>📧 Email Templates — Master Library</strong> in Operations → SOPs &amp; Internal Processes.</blockquote><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p></p><blockquote><strong>HOW TO USE:</strong> Copy the relevant email template, paste into your email client, and fill in all fields marked with <em>()</em>. Personalize every email before sending — never send a template word for word without customizing it. All client communication should come from your @revitalproductions.com email address.</blockquote><p></p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>📑 TEMPLATE INDEX</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><table><tbody><tr><th><p></p><p>#</p><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></th><th><p></p><p>Template</p><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></th><th><p></p><p>When to Use</p><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></th></tr><tr><td><p></p><p>1</p><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></td><td><p></p><p>Free Marketing Assessment Outreach</p><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></td><td><p></p><p>First touch — offering the assessment</p><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td><p></p><p>2</p><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></td><td><p></p><p>Free Marketing Assessment Delivery</p><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></td><td><p></p><p>Sending the completed assessment results</p><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p></p><blockquote><strong>Templates #3-17C</strong> are in the <strong>📧 Email Templates — Master Library</strong> in Operations → SOPs &amp; Internal Processes.</blockquote><p></p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><h1>1 — FREE MARKETING ASSESSMENT OUTREACH</h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>When to use:</strong> First outreach to a cold or warm prospect. Lead with value — offer the assessment before pitching anything.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Subject:</strong> Quick question about <em>(Company Name)</em>'s marketing</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Hi <em>(First Name)</em>,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I came across <em>(Company Name)</em> and wanted to reach out — I noticed <em>(insert one specific observation about their business — e.g. \"your Instagram has great content but your posting has been inconsistent lately\" / \"you're not showing up in local search results for [keyword]\" / \"your ads are running but your landing page could be converting better\")</em>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I run Revital Productions, a marketing and digital production company. We help businesses like yours build a stronger digital presence and turn it into real results.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'd love to offer you a <strong>free Marketing Assessment</strong> — we take a look at your social, website, and ads and send you a quick breakdown of what's working, what's not, and what we'd recommend. No strings attached.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Interested? Just reply and I'll get it started.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>(Your Name)</em></p><p>Revital Productions</p><p><em>(Phone)</em></p><p>revitalproductions.com</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><h1>2 — FREE MARKETING ASSESSMENT DELIVERY</h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>When to use:</strong> Delivering the completed assessment results to the prospect.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Subject:</strong> Your Free Marketing Assessment — <em>(Company Name)</em></p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Hi <em>(First Name)</em>,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thank you for letting us take a look at <em>(Company Name)</em>'s marketing — here's what we found.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>✅ What's Working</strong></p><ul><li><em>(Strength 1)</em></li><li><em>(Strength 2)</em></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>⚠️ Opportunities We Identified</strong></p><ul><li><em>(Opportunity 1 — be specific)</em></li><li><em>(Opportunity 2 — be specific)</em></li><li><em>(Opportunity 3 — be specific)</em></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Our Recommendation</strong></p><p><em>(1-2 sentences summarizing the single most impactful thing they should focus on first)</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'd love to walk you through these findings and talk about how Revital Productions can help you address them. Would you be open to a quick 20-minute call this week?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>(Your Name)</em></p><p>Revital Productions</p><p><em>(Phone)</em></p><p>revitalproductions.com</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>Email Templates — Sales &amp; Prospecting | Revital Productions | June 2026</em></p><p><em>For all other templates see 📧 Email Templates — Master Library in Operations → SOPs &amp; Internal Processes</em></p>",
