    "content": "<h2>Revital Productions | Internal Use Only | July 2026</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>PURPOSE:</strong> This is the quick reference version of the Referral Program. For full rules, step-by-step reward delivery, accounting notes, and the complete checklist — see the <strong>🤝 Referral Program SOP</strong> in Operations → SOPs &amp; Internal Processes.</p></blockquote>\n<blockquote><p><strong>OWNER:</strong> Account Manager / Leadership</p><p><strong>TRACK ALL REFERRALS IN:</strong> CRM Space → 🤝 Referral Tracker</p></blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h3>When to Activate</h3>\n<p>Both must be true before asking for any referrals:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>At least 2-3 clients are active (past onboarding, into regular delivery)</li>\n<li>At least one active client is 🟢 Green health status in CRM</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>Reward Tier Table</h3>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Tier</th><th>Trigger</th><th>Account Credit</th><th>Gift Card</th><th>% of First Month</th><th>Free Service</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Tier 1</td><td>1st referral converts</td><td>$250</td><td>$250</td><td>10%</td><td>Up to $500 add-on</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Tier 2</td><td>2nd referral converts</td><td>$500</td><td>$500</td><td>15%</td><td>Up to $1,000 add-on</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Tier 3</td><td>3rd+ referral converts</td><td>Full free month</td><td>$750</td><td>20%</td><td>2 month upgrade</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Bonus</td><td>Referred client $3,000+/mo</td><td>+$250</td><td>+$250</td><td>+5%</td><td>+1 extra month</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Bonus stacks on top of whichever tier reward the client selects.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>4 Reward Options</h3>\n<p><strong>💳 Account Credit</strong> — applied to next Stripe invoice. No cash value. Forfeited if client churns before next invoice. Default if no selection made within 14 days.</p>\n<p><strong>🎁 Gift Card</strong> — Amazon, Visa prepaid, or Louisiana restaurant. Delivered digitally within 3 business days. Track in QuickBooks if over $600/year to same person.</p>\n<p><strong>📊 Percentage of First Month</strong> — calculated on referred client's first invoice before discounts. Paid as account credit or gift card — client's choice.</p>\n<p><strong>✨ Free Service Add-On</strong> — service NOT in current SOW. One month only, does not auto-renew. Requires leadership approval + scope alignment call. Must start within 30 days.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>Key Rules</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Reward triggers when referred client <strong>signs + pays first invoice</strong> — not before</li>\n<li>Referring client must be active with no overdue invoices</li>\n<li>No self-referrals</li>\n<li>Client has 14 days to select reward — defaults to account credit after 14 days</li>\n<li>Leadership must approve all Free Service Add-On selections</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>How to Ask (quick script)</h3>\n<blockquote><p><em>\"I'm really glad this is working well for you. Quick favor — if you know anyone else who could use help with [service type], I'd love an introduction. We actually have a referral program too, so there's something in it for you if they end up signing on.\"</em></p></blockquote>\n<p>If they're interested → send <strong>Template #18B — Referral Program Info</strong> same day.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>When a Referral Converts — Quick Steps</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Confirm first Stripe payment received</li>\n<li>Determine tier (check Referral Tracker — how many have converted before?)</li>\n<li>Check Bonus (referred client $3,000+/month?)</li>\n<li>Confirm referring client has no overdue invoices</li>\n<li>Send <strong>Template #18 — Referral Reward Notification</strong> same day</li>\n<li>Set 14-day reminder for reward selection</li>\n<li>Deliver reward per selection → send <strong>Template #19 — Reward Confirmation</strong></li>\n<li>Update Referral Tracker at every stage</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3>Task Naming Convention — Referral Tracker</h3>\n<pre><code>[Referring Client] → [Referred Lead] — [Month Year]</code></pre>\n<p>Example: <code>Acme Wellness → Blue Bird Café — July 2026</code></p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>Referral Program — Quick Reference | Revital Productions | July 2026</em></p>\n<p><em>For full details see 🤝 Referral Program SOP in Operations → SOPs &amp; Internal Processes</em></p>",
